' Version 0.2 / 2026-10-29; Draft. Author/accountable: Solution Architect; consulted: Domain, Security, Accessibility, QA; reviewer: Engineering Lead; approver: Product Owner (pending); decision owner: Solution Architect. Assumptions ASM-001–012.
@startuml
' UML-UC-001 scope: author, editorial, reader and finance. FR-DOC-002, FR-PUB-002, FR-COM-001, FR-FIN-001. SOURCE NOT RENDER-VALIDATED.
left to right direction
actor Author
actor Editor
actor Reader
actor Finance
actor Admin
rectangle "Author Studio and Publishing Platform" {
  usecase "Draft and save" as UC1
  usecase "Export without publication" as UC2
  usecase "Submit frozen revision" as UC3
  usecase "Review and approve release" as UC4
  usecase "Discover and purchase" as UC5
  usecase "Read entitled rendition" as UC6
  usecase "Reconcile royalties and payouts" as UC7
  usecase "Handle support and takedown" as UC8
}
Author --> UC1
Author --> UC2
Author --> UC3
Editor --> UC4
Reader --> UC5
Reader --> UC6
Finance --> UC7
Admin --> UC8
legend right
Association = actor initiates or participates.
Approval and authorization are required where scoped.
endlegend
@enduml
